<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foster's half-year net rises two pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foster's half-year net rises two pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   184.8 vs 164.2</p>
<p>    Net profit			   169.4 vs 165.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    5.00 vs  5.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Foster's Brewing Group Ltd is a brewing group and is about 37 percent owned by The Broken Hill Proprietary Co Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.37 vs 1.19</p>
<p>    Other income			   48.2 vs 69.70</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    8.64 vs 8.44</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 5.6  vs profit 12.90</p>
<p>Dividend is nil franked</p>
<p>Pay date Mar 21</p>
<p>Reg date Mar  7</p>
<p>    Tax				     11.00 vs 13.00</p>
<p>    Interest				55.4  vs 44.30</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  38.9  vs 28.40</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
